          "end": 954
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The case of the prosecution, in a nut shell, is that on 30.9.2004, Food Inspector, Shimla visited business premises of the accused known as 'Sharma Dhaba' at Taradevi and found him conducting State Of H.P vs Gopal Sharma on 28 October, 2015 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/88796114/\n1 business.",
